{"ref":"BDB, אֲבוֹי","hw":"אֲבוֹי","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבוֹי</span></big></big>  <strong>interj.</strong> exclam. of pain, <strong>Oh</strong>! <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.29\">Pr 23:29</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹי</span> <em>woe!</em>). Prob. akin to Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܘܽܒܺܝܰܐ</span> <em>alas</em> …! PS <sup>53</sup> <strong>(</strong>AW Ges less prob. as a subst. <em>need</em> from <span dir=\"rtl\">אָבָה</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֶבְיוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_אֶבְיוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיוֹן</a><strong>)</strong>.","next":"BDB, אבח","prev":"BDB, אבוגיל"}